+# Security review
+
+Existing HTTP policy, sandbox entitlements and protected storage remain the boundaries. A cleanup error or ambiguous Core inventory prevents replacement. Process attribution is a separate qualification prerequisite. Never signal a helper on the basis of its name, PID age, or the browser process group alone.
